{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Dino Park Manager</strong> \u2013 a charming and challenging cartoon-style simulation game!  <br>Start from scratch and build a world-class dinosaur park: raise a wide variety of unique dinos, design smart visitor paths, handle unexpected emergencies, and turn your humble attraction into a legendary prehistoric paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.mp4?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a meticulous management pro or a laid-back dino lover, this is your stage to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for Unique Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dinosaur has its own personality\u2014from terrain preferences and favorite foods to social needs and toy demands.<br>T-Rex prefers solitude, Brachiosaurus loves a good stroll, and some dinos just won\u2019t settle unless they\u2019re surrounded by trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4acf.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4acf.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4acf.mp4?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By meeting their needs, you'll cultivate a lineup of prehistoric superstars! Each dino comes with personality traits, and offspring may inherit or mutate these traits. Build your ultimate dino dream team and attract crowds of excited visitors!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entertain Visitors &amp; Handle the Unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors don\u2019t just come to see the dinos\u2014they want sufficient food and drinks, cozy benches, and a park that looks well-kept.<br>Different visitor types have different preferences, and VIPs are especially picky\u2014but the rewards for keeping them happy are well worth the effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/1f58198aae2e06f359459342ce1abe2a.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/1f58198aae2e06f359459342ce1abe2a.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/1f58198aae2e06f359459342ce1abe2a.mp4?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure your dinos are properly taken care of\u2014because if one breaks out, the excitement might quickly turn into chaos and panic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Staff &amp; Keep Things Running</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your staff are the backbone of your park. Assign paleontologists, feeders, security guards, and cleaners to the right jobs and keep everything running smoothly.<br>Send out expeditions to dig up fossils and unlock new dinosaur species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/88a614960071954193995454807afe18.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/88a614960071954193995454807afe18.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/88a614960071954193995454807afe18.mp4?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park grows, you\u2019ll be able to train staff, build a high-efficiency team, and keep things under control\u2014at least until the next dino decides to test the fences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745160?t=1768491290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/2bd2190a7bd503a71c83a3a3a791c18eccad6a44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768491290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/47f8fee7154bac8cef8a0766580d3f0f1ad9231f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768491290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/47f8fee7154bac8cef8a0766580d3f0f1ad9231f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768491290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Dino Park Manager</strong> \u2013 a charming and challenging cartoon-style simulation game!  <br>Start from scratch and build a world-class dinosaur park: raise a wide variety of unique dinos, design smart visitor paths, handle unexpected emergencies, and turn your humble attraction into a legendary prehistoric paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.mp4?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a meticulous management pro or a laid-back dino lover, this is your stage to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for Unique Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dinosaur has its own personality\u2014from terrain preferences and favorite foods to social needs and toy demands.<br>T-Rex prefers solitude, Brachiosaurus loves a good stroll, and some dinos just won\u2019t settle unless they\u2019re surrounded by trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4acf.poster.avif?t=1768491290\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4acf.webm?t=1768491290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/4b52a17cd4aee3bf3ec3e9c3245a4ac